From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rk-forge <noreply@rk-forge.local>
Date: Sat, 12 Jul 2026 09:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] openwrt: rk3506: config-7.1 essentials for rk-forge mainline uboot

czz8888's config-7.1 (from its HZHY MiniEVM target) is missing options
rk-forge's aes board needs when booting under the rk-forge mainline
U-Boot (not OpenWrt's own uboot flow):

- ARCH_MESON=y: lift TEXT_OFFSET so kernel page tables / zrel clear the
  OP-TEE secure RAM (0x0-0x5f000) — without it, data abort at "Starting
  kernel...". rk-forge's buildroot kernel uses the same trick.
- RD_GZIP/XZ/LZ4/LZO=y: decompress the provisioning initramfs (gzip).
- MTD_OF_PARTS=y: materialize the DT fixed-partitions as /dev/mtd0..6.
- DEVTMPFS=y + DEVTMPFS_MOUNT=y: auto-populate /dev so ubiprog can open
  /dev/mtd5 and switch_root finds /dev/ttyS0.
- ATAGS=y + ARM_ATAG_DTB_COMPAT: rk-forge's mainline uboot passes
  bootargs via ATAGS (parameter ATAG: 0x00200800); compat forwards them
  to DT.
- HOTPLUG=y: kmod/uevent.

THUMB2_KERNEL is left at y (OpenWrt default): kmod packages (.ko) are built
thumb2, so turning the running kernel to ARM breaks version magic → kmodloader
rejects them (8 modules failed on SD boot log). ARCH_MESON alone fixes the
data abort; THUMB2 doesn't affect TEXT_OFFSET.

Board-verified: boots to OpenWrt shell under rk-forge mainline U-Boot.
---
diff --git a/target/linux/rockchip/rk3506/config-7.1 b/target/linux/rockchip/rk3506/config-7.1
index 2c5f782..0624f3c 100644
--- a/target/linux/rockchip/rk3506/config-7.1
+++ b/target/linux/rockchip/rk3506/config-7.1
@@ -1217,7 +1217,6 @@ CONFIG_HAVE_PCI=y
 # Generic Driver Options
 #
 # CONFIG_UEVENT_HELPER is not set
-# CONFIG_DEVTMPFS is not set
 CONFIG_STANDALONE=y
 CONFIG_PREVENT_FIRMWARE_BUILD=y
 
@@ -5717,3 +5716,17 @@ CONFIG_ARCH_USE_MEMTEST=y
 CONFIG_PHY_ROCKCHIP_INNO_USB2=y
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_ROCKCHIP_SAI=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_CRC32C=m
+CONFIG_ARCH_MESON=y
+CONFIG_RD_GZIP=y
+CONFIG_RD_XZ=y
+CONFIG_RD_LZ4=y
+CONFIG_RD_LZO=y
+CONFIG_MTD_OF_PARTS=y
+
+# rk-forge RK3506 必备(buildroot kernel.config 有,czz8888 config-7.1 漏的)
+CONFIG_ATAGS=y
+CONFIG_ARM_ATAG_DTB_COMPAT=y
+CONFIG_ARM_ATAG_DTB_COMPAT_CMDLINE_FROM_BOOTLOADER=y
+CONFIG_HOTPLUG=y
+CONFIG_DEVTMPFS=y
+CONFIG_DEVTMPFS_MOUNT=y
